# WiiFin's files as tools/sync-wiifin.sh sees them in WiiFin U.
#
# hand: WiiFin U draws these screens its own way (source/platform/wiiu/ui/):
#   WiiFin's changes there merge, but show on the Wii U only once brought
#   over by hand
hand source/ui/Library
hand source/ui/BrowseHome
#
# ours: WiiFin U's own version of WiiFin's file or folder; WiiFin's changes
#   there (and WiiFin's new files in it) are left out of the merge
ours Makefile
ours README.md
ours README/
ours CONTRIBUTING.md
ours .github/
ours .gitignore
ours assets/
